silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_24_rosetta_stone_cross_domain_sections_01_forge_engineer_entry_point_concrete_anchor_5#productionpath_ra silm:hasLongDescription "The ProductionPath_ra is the two-stage production path r circ a: a \"quality-controlled\" route that first classifies (r) then certifies (a); used in formal adoption pipelines. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ProductionPath_ra', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
